# The working tree is the source of truth for two things that embed it
# verbatim: `include_str!` of the lesson prose (crates/reconverge-tui) and the
# golden/snapshot files the PTY suites compare against. A CRLF checkout
# changes the bytes of both.
#
# The code no longer depends on this -- `pages()` normalizes line endings and
# has a test for it -- but a golden compared byte-for-byte still would, so the
# files are pinned to LF on every platform rather than left to whatever
# `core.autocrlf` a clone happens to have.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.cast binary
